# =============================================================================
# Isuzu Universe - keep embedded business data out of version control
#
# Why this exists: the whole of Isuzu Universe was committable but not ignored.
# Measured 2026-09-22 - a single `git add -A` at the repo root would have staged
# 3,177 files, including HTML artifacts with the pilot accounts embedded:
#   ISUZU_I_Motors_ITUK_Real_Data.html   5.8 MB
#   ISUZU_Network_Atlas_v0_2.html        8.6 MB
#   IDS_2026_atlas0.1.html               4.6 MB
# and 259 lines carrying restricted supplier purchase cost figures across nine
# files in 06_Working. An ignore rule never untracks a file that is already
# committed, so this is safe for everything already in the index - in particular
# 05_AIM_Universe, whose own .gitignore governs what within it is tracked.
# =============================================================================

# --- Embedded business data in HTML -------------------------------------------
# These carry pilot accounts and, in some cases, the restricted cost table. They
# are far too large to version and are built or refreshed locally.
**/*Real_Data*.html
02_Atlas/*.html
04_IDS_AIM_and_IMOTORS/*.html
# A self-contained review application built 2026-09-22. Its own START_HERE says
# "The HTML itself contains internal data and is not a distributor-facing export",
# so it must not be committable. Its source package is a separate zip.
AIM_Opportunity_Review*.html

# --- Scratch, generated and working folders -----------------------------------
# Working and build-intermediate trees: regenerable, and several hold restricted
# figures. 06_Working in particular is where the extracted payload, the pack
# scripts and the extracted engine source live.
06_Working/
_STRATEGY/
_build_v05/
_MERGED_MASTER_2026-09-21/
Universe_IDS_AIM_Cursor_Handoff/
03_Packages/**/RETURNS/

# --- Derived handover packs ---------------------------------------------------
# A handover pack is a copy: tracked source plus untracked working files. It is
# assembled for an upload, never a source of truth, so it does not belong in the
# repository. The .zip form is covered by the root *.zip rule.
GPT_HANDOVER_*/

# --- Local QA output ----------------------------------------------------------
# Screenshots from test runs. Measured 2026-09-22: 8,471 files and 308 MB under
# 05_AIM_Universe/_qa alone, against a 41 MB component. Regenerated every run.
_qa/
_qa*/
**/_qa*/
**/_qa_*/
**/_qa_pdf*/
**/_qa_page*/
**/_qa_v03/
**/_qa_yellow/
**/_qa_yellow_*/
_qa_page*/
_qa_pdf*/
_qa_yellow*/

# --- Extracted and derived data -----------------------------------------------
# Payload extracts, pack payloads and credential-free-but-restricted intermediates.
*_payload*.json
pack03.json
*.local.json

# --- Backups and editor residue -----------------------------------------------
*.bak
*.bak_*
*~
*.tmp
